  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 308.09 E-34 Transmission Crew Report. During wide scale emergencies, a utility shall complete Form E-34 dated 10/2024, available at the department’s website at www.energy.nh.gov, and file one electronic copy with the department.\n\nSource. #14101, eff 10-22-24, EXPIRES: 10-22-34 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 300)",
